</style><h2>Blinky 1.5.23</h2><ul><li><strong>重置后用量偏快时，用尽预估仍会显示。</strong> 在「设置 → 用量」打开「显示预估」后，每周限额刚重置且已用至少 5% 时，卡片仍写出用尽预估，并在下面注明「开头偏快，预估仅供参考」；用量较少时仍写「预计可维持到本轮重置」。<a href="https://github.com/harrisliangsu/blinky-mac/pull/84">#84</a></li></ul><p><a href="https://github.com/harrisliangsu/blinky-mac/releases/tag/v1.5.23">在 GitHub 查看更新说明</a></p>]]></description>
            <description xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[<style>
  h2 { font-size: 1.05em; margin: 0 0 .5em; }
  ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 1.2em; }
  li { margin: .3em 0; }
  p { margin: .8em 0 0; }
</style><h2>Blinky 1.5.23</h2><ul><li><strong>A fast start after a reset still shows the exhaustion estimate.</strong> With Show the estimate on under Settings → Usage, a weekly limit that has just reset and is already at least 5% used still shows how long it may last, with a quieter line that a fast start is only a guide, while lighter use still says the window is expected to last. <a href="https://github.com/harrisliangsu/blinky-mac/pull/84">#84</a></li></ul><p><a href="https://github.com/harrisliangsu/blinky-mac/releases/tag/v1.5.23">Release notes on GitHub</a></p>]]></description>
